  <regions type="content">
    <region left="18" top="0" width="760" height="26" color="#000000" fontSize="12">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;">Grant Bellon</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="38" width="760" height="26" color="#000000" fontSize="12">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;">Lab [9]</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="76" width="760" height="26" color="#000000" fontSize="12">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;">Anemometry and Airfoil Lift</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="124" width="760" height="26" color="#000000" fontSize="12">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;">Introduction</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="158" width="760" height="112" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The objective of this experiment was to measure air velocity in an open-circuit wind tunnel with three instruments (a hot wire anemometer, a turbine (vane) anemometer, and a Pitot-static probe with an inclined manometer) at fan settings from 100% down to 60% of the maximum speed, and then to measure the lift on a 3D-printed NACA 4412 airfoil at angles of attack from 0 to 12 degrees. The lift was read as a negative mass on a digital scale, converted to a lift coefficient, and compared with NASA reference data. Uncertainties were propagated with the Kline-McClintock method.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="286" width="760" height="26" color="#000000" fontSize="12">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;">Given Data</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
